{
 "id": "seg3b",
 "title": "断在哪一关 · Binance",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 66.34,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3b-00",
   "text": "最后一起，也是最大的一起。",
   "spoken": "最后一起，也是最大的一起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.627
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-01",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月 29 日，Binance 多条链的热钱包，被转走约 63.4 亿美元。这是项目方的口径。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 10 月 29 日，Binance 多条链的热钱包，被转走约 63.4 亿美元。这是项目方的口径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-01.wav",
   "start": 4.06,
   "dur": 8.56,
   "speechStart": 4.166,
   "speechEnd": 12.41
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-02",
   "text": "按项目方的初步报告，攻击者先用一份假的面试作业，控制了一名工程师的电脑。",
   "spoken": "按项目方的初步报告，攻击者先用一份假的面试作业，控制了一名工程师的电脑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-02.wav",
   "start": 12.84,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 12.935,
   "speechEnd": 18.93
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-03",
   "text": "另一名工程师的电脑上，放着容器部署的令牌。",
   "spoken": "另一名工程师的电脑上，放着容器部署的令牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-03.wav",
   "start": 19.38,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 19.38,
   "speechEnd": 22.888
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-04",
   "text": "攻击者用它部署了自己的容器，接触到了内部签名服务。",
   "spoken": "攻击者用它部署了自己的容器，接触到了内部签名服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-04.wav",
   "start": 23.28,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 23.28,
   "speechEnd": 27.738
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-05",
   "text": "这是第五关。攻击者没有偷钥匙，他让签名服务替他签。",
   "spoken": "这是第五关。攻击者没有偷钥匙，他让签名服务替他签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-05.wav",
   "start": 28.14,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 28.14,
   "speechEnd": 32.704
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-06",
   "text": "签出来的，是 50 笔操纵 nonce、设置 EIP-7702 委托的交易。",
   "spoken": "签出来的，是 50 笔操纵 nonce、设置 EIP-7702 委托的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-06.wav",
   "start": 33.16,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 33.254,
   "speechEnd": 39.047
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-07",
   "text": "以太坊热钱包的地址，从此会执行攻击者指定的代码。",
   "spoken": "以太坊热钱包的地址，从此会执行攻击者指定的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-07.wav",
   "start": 39.46,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 39.555,
   "speechEnd": 43.967
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-08",
   "text": "然后是第七关。Binance 暂停了提现，关掉了热钱包服务。",
   "spoken": "然后是第七关。Binance 暂停了提现，关掉了热钱包服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-08.wav",
   "start": 44.4,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 44.499,
   "speechEnd": 49.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-09",
   "text": "但委托是链上状态，不受这些开关控制。",
   "spoken": "但委托是链上状态，不受这些开关控制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-09.wav",
   "start": 49.9,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 49.992,
   "speechEnd": 53.094
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-10",
   "text": "按公开的时间，这个委托在链上存活了大约 3 小时 50 分钟。",
   "spoken": "按公开的时间，这个委托在链上存活了大约 3 小时 50 分钟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-10.wav",
   "start": 53.48,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 53.579,
   "speechEnd": 58.262
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-11",
   "text": "告警时间、内部 AI 工具怎么被利用，报告里还没有说清。完整报告还在等。",
   "spoken": "告警时间、内部 AI 工具怎么被利用，报告里还没有说清。完整报告还在等。",
